{"tool_name":"pims_lims","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"pims_lims","home":"https://www.limswiki.org/index.php/PiMS","summary":"Laboratory Information Management System (LIMS) to support the unpredictable workflows of Molecular biology and Protein production labs of all sizes.","addition_date":"2015-02-04T09:14:54Z","last_update_date":"2024-11-25T14:21:17.887792Z","tool_type":["Web API","Web application"],"version":["1"],"collections":["BioMedBridges Tools"],"biotools_curie":"biotools:pims_lims","credit":[{"email":"pims-defects@dl.ac.uk","name":"Chris Morris","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Primary contact"]},{"email":"pims@stfc.ac.uk","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Primary contact"]},{"name":"Chris Morris (STFC)","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Developer"]},{"name":"STFC","typeEntity":"Institute","typeRole":["Provider"]},{"name":"BioMedBridges","typeEntity":"Consortium","typeRole":["Documentor"],"url":"http://www.biomedbridges.eu"}],"documentation":[{"type":["General"],"url":"http://pims.structuralbiology.eu:8080/pims/help/HelpGettingStarted.jsp"},{"type":["Terms of use"],"url":"http://pims.structuralbiology.eu/docs/community%20model%20pimsacademicuseronly%20FINAL.docx"}],"edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"function":[{"operation":[{"term":"Data handling","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_2409"}],"output":[{"data":{"term":"Experiment report","uri":"http://edamontology.org/data_2531"},"format":[{"term":"HTML","uri":"http://edamontology.org/format_2331"},{"term":"MHTML","uri":"http://edamontology.org/format_3556"},{"term":"RDF/XML","uri":"http://edamontology.org/format_3261"},{"term":"TSV","uri":"http://edamontology.org/format_3475"},{"term":"docx","uri":"http://edamontology.org/format_3506"},{"term":"xls","uri":"http://edamontology.org/format_3468"}]}]}],"name":"PiMS LIMS","operating_system":["Linux","Mac","Windows"],"owner":"BioMedBridges","publication":[{"doi":"10.1016/j.jsb.2011.05.008","metadata":{"abstract":"A major advance in protein structure determination has been the advent of nanolitre-scale crystallization and (in a high-throughput environment) the development of robotic systems for storing and imaging crystallization trials. Most of these trials are carried out in 96-well (or higher density) plates and managing them is a significant information management challenge. We describe xtalPiMS, a web-based application for the management and monitoring of crystallization trials. xtalPiMS has a user-interface layer based on the standards of the Protein Information Management System (PiMS) and a database layer which links the crystallization trial images to the meta-data associated with a particular crystallization trial. The user interface has been optimized for the efficient monitoring of high-throughput environments with three different automated imagers and work to support a fourth imager is in progress, but it can even be of use without robotics. The database can either be a PiMS database or a legacy database for which a suitable mapping layer has been developed. \u00a9 2011 Elsevier Inc.","authors":[{"name":"Berry I.M."},{"name":"Blake R."},{"name":"Daniel E."},{"name":"Diprose J.M."},{"name":"Esnouf R.M."},{"name":"Griffiths S.L."},{"name":"Lin B."},{"name":"Morris C."},{"name":"Owens R.J."},{"name":"Stuart D.I."},{"name":"Wilson K.S."}],"citationCount":5,"date":"2011-08-01T00:00:00Z","journal":"Journal of Structural Biology","title":"XtalPiMS: A PiMS-based web application for the management and monitoring of crystallization trials"},"pmcid":"PMC3477317","pmid":"21605683","type":["Primary"]}],"topic":[{"term":"Laboratory information management","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0607"}],"validated":1},"bioschemas":{"name":"PiMS LIMS","home":"https://bio.tools/pims_lims","version":"1","summary":"Laboratory Information Management System (LIMS) to support the unpredictable workflows of Molecular biology and Protein production labs of all sizes.","tool_